        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<p>Goodbye Nikon, hello Canon.\n</p><p>After waiting for over 6 months for Nikon to show up with a counter product to the 5D Mark II and nothing happening, I decided to sell all my Nikon gear and switch. You see, I am a videographer first and a photographer second. So having a DSLR with a full HD function and being able to use photo lenses for video shoots is totally awesome.\n</p><p>But to be honest, the plastic body of the 5D compared to the metal body of the D700 feels like a toy. Anyway, now it's done. Let's see what I get shot with this new beast now.\n</p>\nI'm always posting pictures and videos on my blog in high res, be sure to &lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://jakob.montrasio.net/\">http://jakob.montrasio.net/</a>\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\"&gt;check it out&lt;/a&gt;!",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "DateTimeOriginal": {
          "value": "2009-06-18 23:49",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "Credit": {
          "value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/yakobusan/3638343023/\">Taken with a Canon EOS 5D Mark II.</a>",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "Artist": {
          "value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/37803129@N00\">Jakob Montrasio</a> from Heidelberg, Germany",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
        "LicenseShortName": {
