      "description": "Goodbye Nikon, hello Canon.\n  After waiting for over 6 months for Nikon to show up with a counter product to the 5D Mark II and nothing happening, I decided to sell all my Nikon gear and switch. You see, I am a videographer first and a photographer second. So having a DSLR with a full HD function and being able to use photo lenses for video shoots is totally awesome.\n  But to be honest, the plastic body of the 5D compared to the metal body of the D700 feels like a toy. Anyway, now it's done. Let's see what I get shot with this new beast now.\n \nI'm always posting pictures and videos on my blog in high res, be sure to <a href=\" http://jakob.montrasio.net/ \" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">check it out</a>!",
      "artist": "Jakob Montrasio  from Heidelberg, Germany",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "date": "2009-06-18 23:49"
    },
